MIGRATE is caching connections
MIGRATE cached connections are released after some time
MIGRATE will not overwrite existing keys, unless REPLACE is used
MIGRATE can migrate multiple keys at once
MIGRATE with multiple keys must have empty key arg
MIGRATE with multiple keys migrate just existing ones
MIGRATE with multiple keys: stress command rewriting
MIGRATE with multiple keys: delete just ack keys
MIGRATE AUTH: correct and wrong password cases
